less Mode Core Game VFX", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added combo and power sliders to Endless and Infinite Boss mode bars, mirroring existing fill bars for clearer progress feedback and synchronized per-frame.\n\n* **Enhancements**\n  * Power and combo fill visuals now stay in sync with slider values during timers and reductions.\n  * Score/counter text now restarts an animation on update for stronger visual feedback.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "41f390d4c8b405bf9e7f947fdbabd7eeb7e8dbfb", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/zom-567", "head_sha": "afe8dd01f247194a282318082e6f5b966d89f21e", "additions": 33, "deletions": 8, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-08T23:13:46Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-10T20:07:44Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-10T20:07:44Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-10T20:07:44Z", "html_url": null}}], "records_checked": 2629, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 1, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "manifest_sha256": "d35cbcc83ffe5c3bc1a07052843dc96ecbc2d91630784a944b8eae8433d8c0cd", "freshness": "25dbae47340836014788a32f92a877b2603ea03eba7b5821ace3612edeeb77fd"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes."}, "checksum": "b4bbeb929b612b9b53bec0134e08d316df6f08382efdfe61e6c7dc91490d58